WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.677
Watch and read: Which is the correctly written familiar word?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:08.245
The answer is: the. Look carefully at the letters from left to right.

00:00:09.117 --> 00:00:12.103
Watch and read: Choose the word “and” from this word list.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:16.957
The answer is: and. Read the word as a whole and check its letters.
